<title>JAPAN: Japan MOF offers 1.5 trln yen of 3-month T-bills.</title>
<headline>Japan MOF offers 1.5 trln yen of 3-month T-bills.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Ministry of Finance said on Friday it would offer 1.5 trillion yen of three-month Treasury Bills through a price competitive auction.</p>
<p>The auction will close at 12 p.m. (0300 GMT) and the results will be announced at 2.30 p.m. (0530 GMT).</p>
<p>The issue date will be November 20 and maturity date will be February 20, 1997.</p>
</text>
